WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:21.443
"Please, Your Majesty," said Ann.

2
00:00:21.444 --> 00:00:27.484
She bowed. "You're a wise and fair king."

3
00:00:27.485 --> 00:00:30.439
"Indeed!" said the king.

4
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:34.941
"That wizard didn't take his turn yet," Ann went on.

5
00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:39.629
"Hmm." The king looked at the queen.

6
00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:43.652
She shook her head.

7
00:00:43.653 --> 00:00:46.561
"You must decide, King.

8
00:00:46.562 --> 00:00:51.586
I'm too upset about my lost bookmark."

9
00:00:51.587 --> 00:00:55.411
At last the king shrugged.

10
00:00:55.412 --> 00:01:02.610
"Guards, release the wizard," he said.

11
00:01:02.611 --> 00:01:08.313
"B-b-but . . ." Dirk's face turned bright red.

12
00:01:08.314 --> 00:01:10.726
"Your Majesty!"

13
00:01:10.727 --> 00:01:15.020
The guards released Tom.

14
00:01:15.021 --> 00:01:20.090
Suddenly he spotted something.

15
00:01:20.091 --> 00:01:27.176
Cat was hiding behind a curtain!

16
00:01:27.177 --> 00:01:29.885
"Um . . ." Tom thought fast.

17
00:01:29.886 --> 00:01:33.220
"May I take a moment to prepare my spell?"

18
00:01:33.221 --> 00:01:37.312
"No!" snapped Dirk.

19
00:01:37.313 --> 00:01:42.894
"Yes," said the king.

20
00:01:42.895 --> 00:01:45.693
Tom dashed behind the curtain.

21
00:01:45.694 --> 00:01:49.259
"What should I do, Cat?" he whispered.

22
00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:51.580
Cat held up something.

23
00:01:51.581 --> 00:01:55.732
"I found this," she said.

24
00:01:55.733 --> 00:02:01.316
"It's the queen's royal bookmark!" Tom said.

25
00:02:01.317 --> 00:02:08.566
"Wow! She'll be so happy to see it!"

26
00:02:08.567 --> 00:02:12.787
"Time's up, Wizard!" Dirk snapped.

27
00:02:12.788 --> 00:02:17.384
Cat whispered in Tom's ear.

28
00:02:17.385 --> 00:02:25.104
Then Cat jumped into Tom's pocket.

29
00:02:25.105 --> 00:02:28.426
Tom ran back to the thrones.

30
00:02:28.427 --> 00:02:31.391
"I'm ready now!" he said.

31
00:02:31.392 --> 00:02:33.731
Tom raised his wand.

32
00:02:33.732 --> 00:02:38.031
"Lost thing of the queen," he said.

33
00:02:38.032 --> 00:02:44.047
"Be seen!" Poof!

34
00:02:44.048 --> 00:02:48.555
"It's my royal bookmark!" the queen cried.

35
00:02:48.556 --> 00:02:51.941
"What a clever spell!"

36
00:02:51.942 --> 00:02:53.916
The king jumped up.

37
00:02:53.917 --> 00:03:00.282
"He is the new royal wizard!"

38
00:03:00.283 --> 00:03:08.798
Tom grinned happily.
